OL,3,GStrathclyde                            
OL,5,CToday:FAnother dry day with some long  
OL,6,Fsunny spells for most though the far   
OL,7,Fwest will turn cloudier later. Cold    
OL,8,Fwith some frost early and late inland. 
OL,10,CTonight:FClear spells at first leading 
OL,11,Fto another frost in Lanarkshire. Rain  
OL,12,Freaching the Isles and west coast      
OL,13,Flater this evening edging into the     
OL,14,Fmainland overnight. Strengthening      
OL,15,Fsoutheasterly winds.                   
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
