OL,3,GStrathclyde                            
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloudy with outbreaks of      
OL,6,Frain, preceded by some wet snow on the 
OL,7,Fhighest ground though remaining as     
OL,8,Fsnow on Argyll Hills. Rain turning     
OL,9,Fheavier later. Fresh to strong         
OL,10,Fsoutheasterly winds.                   
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FRain  
OL,13,Fdying out on Wednesday then mainly dry 
OL,14,Fon Thursday. More cloud and rain       
OL,15,Fspreading from west on Friday.         
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
